"split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஊழ்த்த","parts":[{"text":"ஊழ்த்த","lemma":"ஊழ்","gloss":"blossomed/matured"}],"gloss":"blossomed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வண்ண","parts":[{"text":"வண்ண","lemma":"வண்ண","gloss":"beautifully colored"}],"gloss":"beautifully colored","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"துய்ம்மலர்","parts":[{"text":"துய்ம்மலர்","lemma":"துய்ம்மலர்","gloss":"soft downy flowers"}],"gloss":"soft downy flowers","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உதிர","parts":[{"text":"உதிர","lemma":"உதிர்","gloss":"to fall/shed"}],"gloss":"to shed"},{"surface":"தண்ணென்று","parts":[{"text":"தண்","lemma":"தண்","gloss":"cool"},{"text":"என்று","lemma":"என்","gloss":"saying/making"}],"gloss":"coolly"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னாது","parts":[{"text":"இன்னாது","lemma":"இன்னாது","gloss":"painfully/unpleasantly"}],"gloss":"painfully"},{"surface":"எறிதரும்","parts":[{"text":"எறி","lemma":"எறி","gloss":"blow/strike"},{"text":"தரும்","lemma":"தரு","gloss":"giving (auxiliary)"}],"gloss":"blowing"},{"surface":"வாடையொடு","parts":[{"text":"வாடை","lemma":"வாடை","gloss":"north wind"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the north wind"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"what"}],"gloss":"what"},{"surface":"ஆயினள்கொல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினள்","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"became-she"},{"text":"கொல்","lemma":"கொல்","gloss":"particle of doubt/wonder"}],"gloss":"what has become of her?"},{"surface":"என்னாதோரே","parts":[{"text":"என்னாதோர்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"those who do not say/ask"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"those who do not ask"}]}],"literal":"Whether he does not come, or even if he comes, he to us / who has he become, O friend? Moist / blue fresh buds ruffling, of the bushes, / peacock-feather-like bright-spotted karuviḷai flowers shaking, / fine-thorned īṅkai's red buds blossomed / beautiful soft downy flowers to shed, coolly / painfully blowing with the north wind, / \"What has become of her?\" he who does not say!","translation":"Whether he comes or does not come, what is he to us, my friend? He does not even ask, 'What has become of her?' now when the chilly north wind blows painfully, shedding the beautiful, soft, downy blossoms from the red buds of the fine-thorned īṅkai shrub, shaking the bright-spotted karuviḷai flowers that look like peacock feathers, and ruffling the moist, fresh, blue buds on the bushes.","modern":"தோழி! முட்களைக் கொண்ட ஈங்கை மரத்தின் சிவந்த அரும்புகள் மலர்ந்து, அவற்றின் அழகிய மென்மையான பூக்கள் உதிரும்படியும், மயில்தோகையின் கண் போன்ற புள்ளிகளையுடைய கருவிளை மலர்களை அசைக்கும்படியும், புதர்களில் உள்ள குளிர்ந்த நீல நிறப் புதிய மொட்டுகளை அலைக்கும்படியும், குளிர்ந்த வாடைக்காற்று துன்பம் தருமாறு வீசுகிறது. இந்தத் துயரமான காலத்தில், 'அவள் என்ன ஆனாள்?' என்று கூடக் கேட்காத அவர், இனிமேல் வந்தாலும் வராவிட்டாலும் நமக்கு யார்?","explanation":"The speaker is the heroine talking to her friend during the cold season when the north wind blows. The hero has gone away on a journey and has not returned as promised. As the harsh wind ruffles the delicate blue buds and sheds the soft blossoms of the thorny īṅkai shrub, the heroine feels deeply neglected. She expresses her resentment, stating that since he does not even care to ask about her well-being during this painful time, his return or absence no longer matters to her. The imagery of the cold wind shaking the peacock-feather-like karuviḷai flowers and shedding the soft blossoms reflects her own vulnerability and emotional distress, which is characteristic of the mullai landscape associated with patient waiting and the pain of separation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.4],[0.4,1.0],[1.0,1.1],[1.1,1.8],[1.8,2.6],[2.6,2.8],[2.8,3.1],[3.1,3.5],[3.5,4.7],[4.7,4.95],[4.95,5.17],[5.26,5.51],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,6.16],[6.2,6.8],[6.82,6.9],[6.9,7.3],[7.5,7.7],[7.9,8.5],[8.5,9.08],[9.2,10.2],[10.2,10.7],[10.7,11.2],[11.2,11.3],[11.3,12.6],[12.6,13.1],[13.1,13.5],[13.5,14.5],[14.57,15.1],[15.1,15.5],[15.5,15.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.53],[0.53,1.2],[1.2,1.3],[1.3,2.0],[2.0,3.1],[3.1,3.3],[3.3,3.5],[3.5,3.8],[3.8,5.1],[5.1,7.8],[7.8,7.8],[7.8,7.8],[7.8,7.8],[7.8,7.8],[7.8,8.4],[8.4,8.4],[8.4,9.6],[9.82,10.5],[10.57,10.9],[10.9,11.3],[11.3,12.2],[12.2,12.8],[12.8,13.3],[13.3,13.4],[13.4,14.09],[14.6,15.1],[15.1,15.5],[15.5,16.6],[16.6,16.6],[16.6,17.61],[17.61,17.9]]}}